            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.00377/2609.00377v1/rollback_analysis.png",
                "caption": "Figure 7.Recovery from critic-approved errors.The top row shows the full keyframe sequence, while the four panels below illustrate selected reasoning steps. An incorrect fold at frame5→65\\rightarrow 6is approved by the critic and propagates to frame 7. The agent detects the divergence at frame7→87\\rightarrow 8, rolls back to an earlier checkpoint, and reconstructs the sequence using additional tool calls until it finds a corrected fold that remains consistent through the final frame.Recovery from critic-approved errors.",
                "position": 684
